# Crossborder Scraper — commit message (first line = summary, blank line, then body)
#
# Summary: imperative mood, ~72 chars, e.g. "Add Debug nav group for logs and tool catalog"
#
# Body (optional): why the change matters, not a file list.
#
# Hooks run on commit: trailing whitespace, ruff (Python), prettier (apps/web).
# If prettier fails: run "make fmt" or task "Git: format all (before commit)", then git add and commit again.
#
# --- commit message above this line ---
